WEBVTT

00:05:27.349 --> 00:05:30.731
And before I knew it,
I was being introduced to Adam,

00:05:30.755 --> 00:05:32.816
and I reached out to a colleague

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:35.999
I knew had worked
with the company a bunch,

00:05:36.023 --> 00:05:37.521
and she said,

00:05:37.545 --> 00:05:41.584
"Listen, they are obviously
growing really fast,

00:05:41.608 --> 00:05:43.089
they're accomplishing a lot,

00:05:43.113 --> 00:05:46.494
but if I were you I wouldn't trust them
because they're gangsters."

00:05:47.893 --> 00:05:49.780
I didn't know what that meant at first,

00:05:49.804 --> 00:05:52.267
I'm curious about whether
you heard that description

00:05:52.291 --> 00:05:53.591
and what you took from it?

00:05:54.467 --> 00:05:56.029
DF: Actually it's the first time

00:05:56.053 --> 00:05:59.124
I've heard the company described that way.

00:05:59.516 --> 00:06:01.514
I don't feel like that was the case,